      "filename": "1973 AMC Gremlin X and Levi's package finished in Maxi Blue with white stripes at 2017 AMO meet 5of5.jpg",
      "title": "File:1973 AMC Gremlin X and Levi's package finished in Maxi Blue with white stripes at 2017 AMO meet 5of5.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/42/1973_AMC_Gremlin_X_and_Levi%27s_package_finished_in_Maxi_Blue_with_white_stripes_at_2017_AMO_meet_5of5.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:1973_AMC_Gremlin_X_and_Levi%27s_package_finished_in_Maxi_Blue_with_white_stripes_at_2017_AMO_meet_5of5.jpg",
      "width": 2448,
